# This repo tracks only what's needed to build and run the Patient Manager
# app. Everything else in this folder (legacy MATLAB originals, raw data,
# the "patient test" sandbox, launcher .bat scripts, reference PDFs, etc.)
# stays on disk but is intentionally untracked.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/RML_PYTHON_TOOLS

# Inside RML_PYTHON_TOOLS: build output and regenerable caches, not source.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
RML_PYTHON_TOOLS/patient_manager/build/
RML_PYTHON_TOOLS/patient_manager/dist/
*.zip

# Precomputed pedobarograph norms -- Novel_Processing_23.py already detects
# when this is missing and offers to recompute it on first run.
RML_PYTHON_TOOLS/patient_manager/tests/pedobarograph/Novel_Norm/
